  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951250298058444851/log_AOT_test.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>進擊的巨人 / 魔物階級大屠殺</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本整合包並非為膽小者準備，過去你能輕鬆製作的部分物品，現在將變得難以取得。你將置身於一個對未來毫無頭緒的世界，唯一能做的就是努力求生。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/vBCQ5STg78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/vBCQ5STg78</a></strong></span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951254428080549930/lw0tKiU.png\" width=\"231\" height=\"74\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951254436804722708/BH_DS_Team.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\">《進擊的巨人》概述：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>進擊的巨人</em>的故事核心圍繞著生活在三道巨牆內的文明。根據當地流傳的知識，這裡是人類僅存的最後棲息地。居民們深信，一百多年前，由於出現了一種稱為「巨人」的人形生物並開始無差別攻擊、吞噬人類，導致人類瀕臨滅絕。人類殘存勢力退守至三道同心圓狀的巨牆之後，享受了將近一個世紀的和平，而冒險前往牆外的想法則遭到鄙視與禁止。為了對抗巨人，國家軍隊裝備了「立體機動裝置」，這是一套安裝在腰部的抓鉤與瓦斯推進系統，能讓使用者在三维空間中擁有極高的機動性。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951252100615143505/legitness.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">遊戲中的世界樣貌如下：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">精美的動態樹木與 Terraforged 地形模組的完美結合</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951641784830799882/2022-03-10_15.07.54.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地圖已預先生成美麗的雲杉林與河流</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951752388748935208/2022-03-10_23.14.19.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">速度最快的巨人：顎之巨人</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951249336069668904/2022-03-09_11.30.42.png\" width=\"1123\" height=\"630\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">深入熱帶草原</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951752411674992650/2022-03-10_23.19.06.png\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">超大型巨人俯瞰村莊</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951249211599499284/2022-03-09_11.23.49.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑橡木叢林中的獸之巨人&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951249203244437515/2022-03-09_11.21.48.png\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;平原生態系中的一群普通巨人</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951249226724175952/2022-03-09_11.39.01.png\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戰鎚巨人居高臨下注視著你</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951249375458361344/2022-03-09_11.24.59.png\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">作為炮灰的5公尺普通巨人</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951752444705132544/2022-03-10_23.21.59.png\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">女巨人：遊戲七種巨人中速度最快的一位</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951641799137558569/2022-03-10_15.03.12.png\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">從這張圖片中可以看到山坡上的村莊</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951752488942469220/2022-03-10_23.10.26.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防禦力最強的巨人：裝甲巨人</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951752547541082172/2022-03-10_23.24.11.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">動畫中由艾倫所使用的進擊之巨人</span></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951752718467354644/2022-03-10_23.25.30.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1083641617119973428/1084243446493102211/ErenSale.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下是使用巨人化能力後的角色外觀示意圖</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組列表：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/746488043963154553/951261654514036806/unknown.png\"></p>",
